1
00:00:00,879 --> 00:00:03,589
(Penny:)Dr. Plimpton,
I'd like you to meet my colleagues.

2
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:05,217
(Sheldon:)Dr. Rajesh Koothrappali.

3
00:00:05,384 --> 00:00:08,514
(Sheldon:)-And not-a-doctor Howard Wolowitz.
-Hi.

4
00:00:08,721 --> 00:00:11,301
(Raj:)-I'm a big fan of your work.
-Thank you.

5
00:00:11,515 --> 00:00:15,475
(Sheldon:)And, of course, you've already
introduced yourself to Dr. Hofstadter.

6
00:00:16,353 --> 00:00:17,933
(Leonard:)-Hey, you.
-Hey, you.

7
00:00:19,189 --> 00:00:20,649
(Leonard:)Boy, I'm kind of tuckered out.

8
00:00:20,816 --> 00:00:22,566
(Leonard:)How are you feeling, Elizabeth?

9
00:00:23,152 --> 00:00:25,192
(Elizabeth:)You know what? I am a little tired.

10
00:00:25,362 --> 00:00:27,782
(Elizabeth:)Would you be a dear
and get me a cup of coffee?

11
00:00:27,948 --> 00:00:30,038
(Leonard:)Sure. Black, right?

12
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,580
(Elizabeth:)Actually, now I think I want it
hot, brown and sweet.

13
00:00:34,788 --> 00:00:36,578
(Leonard:)Coming right up.

14
00:00:42,087 --> 00:00:43,127
(Raj:)What?

15
00:00:43,297 --> 00:00:45,717
What do you mean, "what?"
It's "Halo" night.

16
00:00:45,883 --> 00:00:46,923
(Raj:)I can't. I'm too sick.

17
00:00:47,092 --> 00:00:48,672
[COUGHING]
Go away.

18
00:00:49,511 --> 00:00:51,341
(Howard:)That's why we moved
"Halo" night here.

19
00:00:51,513 --> 00:00:53,053
(Howard:)I brought my mom's chicken soup.

20
00:00:53,265 --> 00:00:54,305
(Raj:)I'm not hungry.

21
00:00:54,475 --> 00:00:56,305
ELIZABETH:
Don't send him away. Let him in.

22
00:00:56,477 --> 00:01:02,027
-Who is that?
-I bought a parrot.

